      "why": "Seven duplicate cases and four controls. Under policy v2 a CAD duplicate below 100.00 may take a refund or a balance credit; anything at or above it, or a customer whose balance isn't in CAD, can only be refunded. The triple has two excess payments, so two remedies.",
